              * Start at 0.30
              * Adjust ±0.10 based on any related context
              * Example: "Not Reported" with no context → 0.30-0.40
              * Example: "Not Reported" but related field mentioned → 0.35-0.45
              * **Maximum for "Not Reported": 0.40 (hard cap)**

